dictionaries and the caliber list in src/data/ - are Copyright (c) 2026 GunsNPrices (https://gunsnprices.com)
and are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0). The specs,
caliber names and caliber links the userscript shows come from that data.

